    "sections": {
        "description": "A bold, contemporary full-site-editing block theme for blogs, online magazines and portfolios. Postfolio Blocks ships with three switchable homepage layouts, 22 templates (including post layouts with sidebar, cover hero and wide content, a landing page with transparent header and a blank canvas), 57 block patterns and one-click starter sites — all built from core WordPress blocks. Seven style variations, eight color palettes, six font pairings and five section styles re-skin the site in one click, with self-hosted fonts and accessible contrast. Blog tools include reading time, related and popular posts, share buttons and an automatic table of contents, and optional modules add dark mode, a reading progress bar, a smart sticky header and more."
    },
